sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant AM as Auth Middleware
    participant US as User Service
    participant UR as User Repo
    participant DS as Downstream Service
    participant DB as Database

    C->>AG: Any authenticated request (e.g., GET /teams/{teamId}/members)
    AG->>AM: verify JWT, extract userId
    alt JWT invalid
        AM-->>AG: 401 Unauthorized
        AG-->>C: 401
    else valid
        %% Throttle updates to reduce writes
        AM->>US: maybeUpdateLastSeen(userId, now)
        US->>UR: getLastSeen(userId)
        UR->>DB: SELECT lastSeen FROM users WHERE id=?
        DB-->>UR: lastSeen
        UR-->>US: lastSeen

        alt stale or null (e.g., >5 min)
            US->>UR: updateLastSeen(userId, now)
            UR->>DB: UPDATE users SET lastSeen=? WHERE id=?
            DB-->>UR: ok
            UR-->>US: ok
        else fresh
            US-->>AM: skip update
        end

        %% Continue to target service
        AM-->>DS: forward request with user context
        DS-->>AG: response
        AG-->>C: 200 OK
    end
